# @@NAME@@

A RuneLite plugin.

With Java 11 and Gradle 8 on your `PATH` (installed directly or through `nix develop`):

```sh
make build
make run
```

See [DEVELOPMENT.md](DEVELOPMENT.md) for setup, updates, and creating more plugins.

Before publishing, review the metadata in `runelite-plugin.properties`,
document the plugin here, and choose a license.
